# patches-local/include — CloudLinux series entries we FORCE-KEEP despite the
# importer's filename-based classification scoring them "skip".
#
# One SRPM patch basename per line (# comments allowed). This file is
# HAND-maintained; the importer reads it and forces these patches into
# patches/series at their correct spec position, always from the current SRPM
# (so a refresh keeps them up to date). Each entry MUST say why.

# Foundational: adds the 'p' (path) zend_parse_parameters type and DEFINES the
# CHECK_NULL_PATH / CHECK_ZVAL_NULL_PATH macros in Zend/zend_API.h. Several kept
# CVE/bug patches (e.g. CVE-2015-4598, bug71860) call CHECK_NULL_PATH, so without
# this the link fails with "undefined reference to CHECK_NULL_PATH". Named for the
# '-p' option so the CVE/bug/hardened filename heuristic misses it.
p_option.patch
